<title>USA: PerSeptive gains $38 mln from purchase.</title>
<headline>PerSeptive gains $38 mln from purchase.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerSeptive Biosystems Inc said on Wednesday it received over $38 million in stock and cash from the closing of Millennium Pharmaceuticals Inc's acquisition of ChemGenics Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
<p>Millennium and ChemGenics announced the deal on January 20 and completed it Monday.  For its ChemGenics holdings, PerSeptive received 1.61 million Millennium shares and $4 million in cash.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
